# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# PROGRESS.md (dev log) and CLAUDE.md (the working brief for the agents on this
# repo) live here for contributors, but must not be part of the public site.
# Serve a 404 for them instead of handing the file to visitors.
/PROGRESS.md   /404.html   404
/CLAUDE.md     /404.html   404

# The instruction stack is the product. Generated decks under copywriting/ are
# verbatim copies of it and are gitignored, but this directory is inside the
# served tree — so anything that lands here by accident (a stray regeneration
# before a deploy) would be public. Serve a 404 for the whole directory.
/copywriting/*   /404.html   404

# Development directories. None of these are part of the site, and eval/ in
# particular drives the prompt engine — a harness is a map of what it tests.
/eval/*          /404.html   404
/tests/*         /404.html   404
/scripts/*       /404.html   404
/artifacts/*     /404.html   404
